# Read by Flux's source-controller (same syntax as .gitignore): paths listed
# here are left out of the artifact it builds from this repository.
#
# Flux only needs the Phase 10 manifests, so everything else (the other
# phases, the application source code, docs, CI) is excluded. Syncs stay
# small, and a change elsewhere in the repository never reaches the cluster.
/*
!/phases/
/phases/*
!/phases/10-observability-and-monitoring/
/phases/10-observability-and-monitoring/*
!/phases/10-observability-and-monitoring/solution/
